    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/372f59f05f7fe7d2be07530e282b100d.poster.avif?t=1736754886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/372f59f05f7fe7d2be07530e282b100d.webm?t=1736754886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/372f59f05f7fe7d2be07530e282b100d.mp4?t=1736754886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/d8cf1693a8871125143156308991434c.avif?t=1736754886\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/35e9f5494fb8876b824a5b0b92aaf154.avif?t=1736754886\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In the post-apocalyptic world of Hopeland, players find themselves on a perilous journey in a chaotic and ever-changing landscape. Following a catastrophic event that has reshaped everything, players belong to the last surviving group on Earth. Their ultimate goal is to survive in a world that has deviated far from normalcy. Amidst the turmoil and danger, their unwavering determination drives them to seek a path to Hopeland a sanctuary shrouded in both hope and danger, yet the last bastion of hope for rebuilding life.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/da76c10a68b0b1d6006fb4697a230bb1.avif?t=1736754886\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The primary objective of Hopeland is to help players survive in a post-apocalyptic world by effectively utilizing resources and the environment to their advantage while navigating through constant peril. Players must navigate through a world fraught with danger, including natural disasters and hordes of zombies.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/involves.png?t=1736754886\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resource Management: Players must learn resource management skills, including scavenging for items, gathering food and water in their surroundings, collecting clothing, and essential survival equipment.</h2><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting and Upgrading Equipment: Players have the ability to craft and upgrade weapons and gear to enhance their chances of survival. They must scavenge for materials and utilize available tools effectively.</h2><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cooperation and Building Alliances: Cooperation with other survivors is crucial to resist and counter the dangers. Building alliances and forming strong teams can be essential in surviving and thriving in this harsh world.</h2><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Journey to Hopeland: The ultimate goal is to make the perilous journey to Hopeland, the last safe haven for those seeking to start anew. Players must exercise caution and efficiently utilize resources when embarking on this quest.</h2></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/372f59f05f7fe7d2be07530e282b100d.poster.avif?t=1736754886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/372f59f05f7fe7d2be07530e282b100d.webm?t=1736754886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/372f59f05f7fe7d2be07530e282b100d.mp4?t=1736754886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/d8cf1693a8871125143156308991434c.avif?t=1736754886\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/35e9f5494fb8876b824a5b0b92aaf154.avif?t=1736754886\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In the post-apocalyptic world of Hopeland, players find themselves on a perilous journey in a chaotic and ever-changing landscape. Following a catastrophic event that has reshaped everything, players belong to the last surviving group on Earth. Their ultimate goal is to survive in a world that has deviated far from normalcy. Amidst the turmoil and danger, their unwavering determination drives them to seek a path to Hopeland a sanctuary shrouded in both hope and danger, yet the last bastion of hope for rebuilding life.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/da76c10a68b0b1d6006fb4697a230bb1.avif?t=1736754886\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The primary objective of Hopeland is to help players survive in a post-apocalyptic world by effectively utilizing resources and the environment to their advantage while navigating through constant peril. Players must navigate through a world fraught with danger, including natural disasters and hordes of zombies.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945860/extras/involves.png?t=1736754886\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resource Management: Players must learn resource management skills, including scavenging for items, gathering food and water in their surroundings, collecting clothing, and essential survival equipment.</h2><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting and Upgrading Equipment: Players have the ability to craft and upgrade weapons and gear to enhance their chances of survival. They must scavenge for materials and utilize available tools effectively.</h2><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cooperation and Building Alliances: Cooperation with other survivors is crucial to resist and counter the dangers. Building alliances and forming strong teams can be essential in surviving and thriving in this harsh world.</h2><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Journey to Hopeland: The ultimate goal is to make the perilous journey to Hopeland, the last safe haven for those seeking to start anew. Players must exercise caution and efficiently utilize resources when embarking on this quest.</h2></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hope Land is a land of dreams that every survivor wants to visit at least once. It is up to you to survive and reach your goal and how.",
